  "title": "Start a fitting"
 },
 "description": "Start a guided menswear fitting with QuarterMaster. Use when someone asks what a man should wear or buy for an occasion: \"what should I wear to my friend's wedding\", a work dinner, a first date, a rainy weekend away, coffee with friends, or \"I have nothing to wear\". Returns the tailor's questions in order, the occasions it dresses for, and the full kit each impression calls for, so the person can compare. The answers are the inputs to quartermaster_plan_outfit. Limits: menswear only; prices are US dollars from the QuarterMaster ledger of 53 makers, checked September 2026, not live store prices; no stock, size or delivery checks; no orders.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "room": {
    "description": "Optional. The occasion, if already known.",
